packages/mesh-plugin/bundle/

# The phone/desktop consumers install this tarball by URL + sha256 and never
# run a build, so the artifact has to live in the repository: without it the
# only copy of a fixed plugin is a local cache that a clean checkout cannot
# reproduce. `pack-phone.py` is deterministic (fixed mtime/uid/gid, sorted
# members, gzip mtime 0), so re-running it must produce a byte-identical file.
!packages/mesh-plugin/dist-phone/dsh-mesh-plugin-*.tgz
